OL,3,ANHS boss warns of 'horrible spike' in  
OL,4,Aflu as hospital admissions surge       
OL,6,FA surge in severe cases of flu has     
OL,7,Fprompted health officials in England to
OL,8,Furge those most at risk to get         
OL,9,Fvaccinated as soon as possible.        
OL,11,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)  
OL,12,Fsaid hospital admission rates had      
OL,13,Fsoared by almost 80% over the last week
OL,14,Fto the highest at this time of year    
OL,15,Fsince before the Covid pandemic.       
OL,17,FFlu vaccine uptake so far among those  
OL,18,Faged 65 and over was just under 68% -  
OL,19,Flower than where it usually was at this
OL,20,Ftime of year, the agency said. The flu 
OL,21,Fcan be very serious for those living   
OL,22,Fwith some long-term health conditions. 
